    },
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "QueryEngine · 整段会话",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 414,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 62,
      "padding": 12,
      "fontFamily": "SFMono-Regular",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "minFontSize": 23,
      "fontWeight": 700,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "align": "center",
      "appearance": "inverted"
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "QueryEngine 的四项会话职责\n恢复已有会话　·　等待并接收多次用户输入\n累计 Token 与费用　·　保存会话状态",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 492,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 152,
      "padding": 22,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "minFontSize": 18,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.32,
      "align": "center",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "每次输入各自启动一次 queryLoop；完成后，都回到同一个外层会话。",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 54,
      "padding": 10,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "minFontSize": 19,
      "fontWeight": 650,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "align": "center",
      "appearance": "label"
    },
    {
      "id": "R01",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "用户第 1 次输入：“读取文件”\n\nqueryLoop #1\n模型 → 工具 → 结果 →（可重复）\n当前任务完成　↩ 返回同一个 QueryEngine",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 202,
      "padding": 22,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "minFontSize": 17,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.22,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "R02",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "用户第 2 次输入：“继续修改”\n\nqueryLoop #2\n模型 → 搜索或编辑 → 验证\n当前任务完成　↩ 返回同一个 QueryEngine",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 642,
      "y": 730,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 202,
      "padding": 22,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "minFontSize": 17,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.22,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "N01",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "两层循环，问的是不同问题",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 954,
      "width": 1112,
      "height": 54,
      "padding": 10,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 24,
      "minFontSize": 20,
      "fontWeight": 700,
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "align": "center",
      "appearance": "inverted"
    },
    {
      "id": "C01",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "外层问：“整段会话还好吗？”\n\n用户下一句话什么时候到来？\n会话是否需要从磁盘恢复？\n总预算和 Token 已经使用多少？\n当前状态什么时候保存？",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1024,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 278,
      "padding": 24,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "minFontSize": 18,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "C02",
      "type": "technical",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "内层问：“这次任务怎样做完？”\n\n这一轮是否需要调用工具？\n工具结果怎样送回模型？\n遇到可恢复错误时怎么办？\n何时产生最终回答并返回外层？",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 642,
      "y": 1024,
      "width": 534,
      "height": 278,
      "padding": 24,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "minFontSize": 18,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "card"
    },
    {
      "id": "P02",
      "type": "portrait",
      "portraitId": "toyokawa-sakiko-serious-v1",
      "x": 64,
      "y": 1338,
      "width": 150,
      "height": 150,
      "shape": "rounded",
      "grayscale": true
    },
    {
      "id": "D02",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": "丰川祥子",
      "text": "这是关注点分离。\n外层不必知道 API 错误怎样恢复；内层也不必知道用户下一句话何时到来。\n两边可以各自变化，而不会把所有状态缠成一团。",
      "direction": "horizontal",
      "x": 236,
      "y": 1326,
      "width": 940,
      "height": 174,
      "padding": 24,
      "fontFamily": "PingFang SC",
      "fontSize": 23,
      "minFontSize": 18,
      "fontWeight": 600,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "align": "left",
      "appearance": "dialogue"
    },
    {
      "id": "F01",
      "type": "narration",
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "QueryEngine 管“一段关系”，\nqueryLoop 管“一次任务”。",
